Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||08-08-2001||05:38 PM||||Joe-<P>Like I mentioned in the "Fiero Playing Cards" thread- I'm a Graphic Designer and would love to help.  I've been digging through my collection of photos looking for the history of my Fiero in images- I've got recent ones, but still digging for the photos when I first bought it.  Anyway, I'll be starting a layout soon to see what we can come up with! What specs are you looking to get (ie: resolution, border/bleeds, format, etc...)  <P>I also have a complex (50+ hours) Adobe Illustrator 8 drawing of my Fiero that I worked on last year- It may not look like much to most people, but anyone who has used Illustrator will appreciate it!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierodraw.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg">  <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
